WEBVTT

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.290
<b>fushigi na yasuragi kanshou</b>

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.290
<b>不思議な安らぎ観賞</b>

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.290
<b>This strange feeling of peaceful enjoyment</b>

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.880
<b>shibaraku kono mama</b>

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.880
<b>しばらくこのまま</b>

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.880
<b>Will continue for a while</b>

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.470
<b>rikai funou puroburemu bousou</b>

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.470
<b>理解不能プロブレム暴走</b>

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.470
<b>An impossible to solve problem runs wild</b>

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.760
<b>genin wa?</b>

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.760
<b>原因は？</b>

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.760
<b>And the cause is?</b>

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:42.230
<b>kimi to iru to kudaranai oshie wasureru</b>

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:42.230
<b>君といるとくだらない教え忘れる</b>

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:42.230
<b>Whenever I'm with you, I forget all about these boring lessons</b>

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:50.020
<b>kono henka kara umaretahonshin ukeireyou</b>

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:50.020
<b>この変化から生まれた本心受け入れよう</b>

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:50.020
<b>I want you to accept the true feelings born from this change</b>

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:53.990
<b>harimegutta saisho no kokoro</b>

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:53.990
<b>張り巡った最初の心</b>

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:53.990
<b>I reeled in the first heart I could hook</b>

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.450
<b>taguriyose sotto seebushita</b>

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.450
<b>手繰り寄せそっとセーブした</b>

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.450
<b>Carefully saving it</b>

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:02.080
<b>hyouteki ni fukuzatsu na mune no yami takushite</b>

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:02.080
<b>標的に複雑な胸の闇託して</b>

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:02.080
<b>I use the complicated darkness in my heart on my target</b>

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:05.160
<b>Care me! Care me! Care me! Care me!</b>

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:05.160
<b></b>

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:05.160
<b></b>

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:11.170
<b>naiteru kokoro atatamete yatto kizuita</b>

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:11.170
<b>泣いてる心温めてやっと気づいた</b>

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:11.170
<b>As I warmed the crying heart, I finally realised</b>

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:20.010
<b>watashi no himitsu heiki wa nani yori mo tsuyoku katakumusunda</b>

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:20.010
<b>私の秘密兵器はなによりも強く硬く結んだ</b>

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:20.010
<b>That more than anything, my secret weapon is strongly, firmly bound</b>

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:23.270
<b>kimi to no tsunagari</b>

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:23.270
<b>君との繋がり</b>

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:23.270
<b>With my connection to you</b>

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>「Manservant</b>

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>「Manservant</b>

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>~Competition~」</b>

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.980
<b>~Competition~」</b>

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:47.290
I'm really sorry.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:51.170
For having you clean my workplace even though it's Sunday.

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:54.420
I intended to clean it up myself when I found some free time.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:58.040
Good grief dad, you know you never have free time.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:01:59.800
You said tomorrow was the deadline?

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:00.780
Yeah.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.180
When I'm done with this, I have to come up with a name for a new series.

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:05.500
I have to put my spirit into it!

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:09.350
Thanks for the hard work.

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:15.510
Here, have some coffee.

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.120
Oh.

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:17.660
How thoughtful, Momo-chan.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:19.380
You'll be a great wife!

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:20.990
Oh my.

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:22.910
You're too much, father.

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.860
Zastin-san and the others, here's some for you.

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:27.730
Oh!

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:29.420
Thank you very much, Momo-sama!

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:31.630
It's delicious!

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.390
I'm sorry that I haven't been able to see you much lately,

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:36.630
I've been so busy with work.

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.160
It's fine.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:41.260
Please do your best in helping out father.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.010
Okay!

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:44.890
Aren't they supposed to be bodyguards?

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:53.520
Okay dad, we'll be going home now.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.450
Yeah! Thank you!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:58.680
Ah, Mikan!

00:02:58.680 --> 00:02:59.530
Wait a moment!

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:02.410
Since you're here why don't you make dinner?

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:03.660
Eh?

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:04.610
It's fine isn't it?

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:06.330
I'm begging you!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.650
I'm so tired of eating convenience store lunches...

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:12.750
Then why don't we head home first, Rito-san?

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:13.290
Eh?!

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:19.010
Don't worry, Mikan-san, I'll take care of things at home.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:21.610
She's such a good-natured girl.

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:24.960
If something happens it's your fault, dad.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:25.820
Like what?

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:35.700
It's good to see your father's work is going well, isn't it?

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:36.430
Yeah.

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:38.650
He works a little too hard sometimes, though.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.320
It's here, it's here!

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.720
The words that I love.

00:03:43.720 --> 00:03:46.000
Unexpected good luck.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.700
Nana and Onee-sama and the others aren't at home right now,

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:52.810
so when we go home we'll be alone!

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:57.060
I'll show Rito-san the adult game I bought...!

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.220
「Ah... N-No...」

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.220
<b>「Ah... N-No...」</b>

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.220
<b>Moena</b>

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.220
Ah... N-No...

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.600
Moena

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.600
「T-This is embarrassing...」

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.600
<b>「T-This is embarrassing...」</b>

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:18.480
Rito-san, next you click here.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.180
Here?

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:23.570
Yes, right there.

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:27.450
H-Here, too?

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.030
That's right.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:31.240
Click.

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:34.310
C-Click. {repeating}

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.350
Click. Click. Click.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:40.160
Click... Click.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:42.670
Do you want to try it out on the real thing?

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:46.180
I'm fine with it if you want to try.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.490
Click!

00:04:52.490 --> 00:04:53.480
Click!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.440
D-Double...

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:56.310
Double click!

00:04:57.050 --> 00:05:01.440
D-Double... Double click!

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:08.890
I've been thinking it was about time to get
revenge for that incident in the gym storehouse.

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:09.890
Oh!

00:05:09.890 --> 00:05:10.450
Eh?

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.080
Yo!

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.580
It's been a while.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:15.940
Nemesis!

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:17.520
Why are you here?

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:21.340
I was bored so I came to play, Yuuki Rito.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:23.350
Have you forgotten?

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:28.970
I told you I was going to make you my manservant.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:32.590
Rito-san is not your manservant!

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:33.470
Oh?

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:36.890
But you can't say he belongs to you either, Princess Momo.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:38.400
Don't speak to me so casually!

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:40.090
Oh, scary.

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:42.060
Are you going to shoot a beam again?

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.000
Wait a second!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:43.650
Don't fight!

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:45.650
Try to get along, okay?

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:48.150
Will you play with me then?

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:48.890
Huh?

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.660
I told you, I'm bored.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:53.660
Rito-san, you know you don't have to listen, right?!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:57.830
Okay, but just a little bit.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:58.670
Rito-san!

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.760
All right, it's decided!

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.590
Let's go, manservant!

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:10.330
Momo, we still don't know anything about Nemesis.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.180
We might be able to find something out.

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.550
Rito-san...

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:16.560
That may be, but...

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:18.860
Hurry up, manservant!

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:23.940
And we finally had some time alone...!

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:32.930
Where are we going?

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:34.390
Let's see...

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:38.020
By all rights, I should be the one by Rito-san's side.

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:39.920
How did it turn out like this?

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:43.960
Ah, hey!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:44.580
Hm?

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:45.620
What is it?

00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.570
Your arm is wrapped around mine, and uh...

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:50.280
What, you don't like being close to me?

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:52.220
It's not that...!

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.400
Why are you acting embarrassed?

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:58.600
You were quite aggressive when you attacked me before, weren't you?

00:07:03.640 --> 00:07:04.790
Anyway, let's go!

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:05.820
Hurry up!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:08.240
Where are you taking me?

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:19.720
It's a thousand years too soon for you to beat your master!

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:20.500
They really are playing...

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:21.660
All right!

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:22.680
Next is that!

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.000
Let's go, manservant!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:42.020
This place is pretty fun, I like it!

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:42.900
Is that so?

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.230
What is it?

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:48.900
Did you see something you like?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:49.610
This!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:51.150
It's cute!

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.490
That?!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.940
Ah... I'm sorry.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:00.930
Okay.

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:01.790
In that case...

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:06.420
I got it.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.660
Hey!

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:09.380
Um... Excuse me...

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:19.670
Why you...!

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:21.630
What, was it bad to take it...?

00:08:21.630 --> 00:08:22.900
Of course it was!

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:24.400
Hey, Momo.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.750
She didn't know that.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:27.970
Rito-san...!

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:29.270
That's right, Princess Momo.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:32.650
If you get irritated too much, it's bad for your figure.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:35.170
I'm getting hungry, manservant.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:40.910
Come again.

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:48.010
You like dumplings?

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:48.840
Yeah.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:57.300
This planet's culture is varied and pretty interesting.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.860
I can understand why Golden Darkness and Mea,

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:03.060
who were created from human genes, would be drawn to it.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.940
Do you mean that you're different from Yami and Mea, Nemesis?

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:07.940
That's right.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.730
My development process was completely different.

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:16.700
But if you said that Yami and Mea are the same because of that, you'd be wrong.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.700
Psycho Dive is an ability only Mea can use,

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:25.120
and the Darkness transformation is something that only Yami, as a prototype, was given.

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:28.880
What exactly is Darkness...?

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:30.580
You're giving it to me?

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:31.480
Idiot.

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:33.690
I want you to feed it to me.

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:37.010
You can only ask your master a question if you serve. {lit: if you act like a manservant}

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:48.510
Well done, manservant.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:50.190
No complaints.

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:55.360
All right.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.860
Next, massage my shoulders. {She's intentionally pissing off Momo lol}

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:58.240
Why, you...!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:15.710
You have quite the technique.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.690
You certainly know how to please a woman.

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:21.470
All I'm doing is giving you a massage, though...

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:22.880
What?

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:24.590
Are you jealous, Princess Momo?

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:26.480
N-Not really!

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:29.100
That's enough, manservant.

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.610
Good work.

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:31.680
Then-?!

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.060
Yeah.

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.820
You asked me "What is Darkness", right?

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:40.530
Very well, I'll tell you.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:43.030
Darkness...

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:48.580
Is the release of a dark power.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:56.300
The ultimate transformation, which will guide this galaxy into chaos.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.520
That's it?!

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:06.890
Don't give me that delusional-sounding explanation, be more specific!

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:08.440
Oh, scary.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:09.230
Eh?

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:13.070
This woman seems pretty dangerous, Yuuki Rito.

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:15.900
You should be wary of trusting her.

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:18.810
H-How can she say something like that?!

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:20.450
How dare she say that to Rito-san!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.300
See?

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.990
Princess Momo is a dangerous woman.

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.560
R-Rito-san.

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:31.460
That's not true.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:34.170
Momo is getting angry for my sake.

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:36.420
I don't think she's dangerous at all.

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.510
You're just as naive a man as Mea said.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:46.850
Why do you trust people like that?

00:11:46.850 --> 00:11:48.030
Rito-san!

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:51.680
Princess Momo, you win this time.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:52.940
Eh?

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:01.840
Man, Mikan's stamina meal really is superb.

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:02.740
Right, Mikan?

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:03.740
Huh?

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.430
Thanks!

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:09.970
Ah.

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:11.460
Welcome home, Mikan!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.170
Welcome home.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.540
Momo's preparing dinner.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.970
I-I'm helping too, big sister.

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:19.290
Eh, is that so?! {Lala}

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:20.380
Okay, okay. {Rito}

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:20.380
Don't overreact so much! {Nana}

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.780
Huh? Did I? {Lala 2}

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.150
You really like this game, huh? {Rito 2}

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:25.010
Nothing... happened...?

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:27.900
Ah!

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:29.510
Welcome home, Mikan-san.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:33.770
I tried out the seasoning you told me about before.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:38.090
I have the feeling she's in an especially good mood, though.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:45.210
What a wonderful day this was!

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:49.910
I can't believe that Rito-san said that about me!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.960
Rito-san is in the bath.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:05.020
I'll have to be careful not to be noticed by Mikan-san.

00:13:18.850 --> 00:13:22.610
I have the feeling I can be more bold than usual today!

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:30.410
Rito-san, I came to wash your back-

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:39.170
Hm?

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:40.250
Oh, Princess Momo.

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:42.010
We meet again.

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:46.260
How did you get in here?!

00:13:46.610 --> 00:13:47.830
How...?

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:49.830
I came in through the front door.

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:52.010
I unlocked the door, though.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:54.890
What did you come for?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:59.730
When I approached, I noticed my manservant was in the bath,

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:02.110
so I thought I'd wash his back for him.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.480
With my body.

00:14:05.010 --> 00:14:05.940
Hm?

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.990
You look displeased about something.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.610
Using trans is unfair!

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:11.990
Too bad, it comes in handy!

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:15.520
What are you trying to do?

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.820
Your objective is Yami-san, right?

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.620
Rito-san shouldn't have anything to do with it.

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:21.380
That's not true.

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:26.210
This man is the catalyst for Golden
Darkness becoming more human-like.

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:33.160
Mea has also begun to show interest in humans after having contact with him.

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:36.370
A person who can change the nature of a trans weapon...

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:40.580
It's more convenient to have him as my manservant than to leave him be.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:45.190
But more importantly, Princess Momo...

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:49.700
My nature is to take everything that others desire.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:56.610
The harem plan you've concocted... I think you'd better give it up.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.790
This one is mine.

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:01.940
You...

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:11.610
Mikan, there's trouble!

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:12.930
Can you come here?!

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.560
Rito, what is it, are you okay-?!

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.030
What are you doing?!

00:15:21.030 --> 00:15:22.510
I-It's not what it looks like!

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:25.020
I was doing it to protect Rito-san from Nemesis!

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.090
Where is she?

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:28.760
Where...? She's right here-

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:29.670
Huh?

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:31.180
So where is she?

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:33.630
Well, Mikan-san, that's...

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:40.130
It really is worth it to tease Princess Momo.

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:43.910
It looks like I'll be able to enjoy myself for a while until Darkness activates.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.300
In the first place what were you thinking letting Rito get so dizzy?

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:49.890
Now I know for sure...

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:50.330
And what were you doing?! {Mikan's rant}

00:15:49.890 --> 00:15:52.880
Nemesis is my archenemy!

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:52.880
You can't just come in like that- {Cut off rant}

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:03.340
Yo, thanks for coming.

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:05.150
Are you all right, dad?

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.110
Yeah.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.770
We're in the last stretch.

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:12.320
We only need to draw the scenery for three more pages and after that, we're done.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.990
I'm sorry for being late!

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:16.240
I'm not your editor...

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:21.160
A-Anyway, don't push yourself too hard.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:22.960
Yeah, thanks.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:33.220
I wonder if my old man will be all right?

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.300
It really is worrisome, isn't it?

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:39.510
I cooked some food the way I learned from Mikan-san,

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:42.810
so it would be nice if that helps him feel better.

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:45.470
The bath is free now!

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:47.060
Yes!

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:49.570
You're tired from today right, Rito-san?

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.480
You can go ahead.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:51.990
Eh?

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.160
Oh?

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:55.640
You aren't taking a bath today?

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:58.190
No, I will, but...

00:16:58.190 --> 00:16:59.600
Momo, are you...?

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:00.730
Huh?

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:02.780
Momo-san! {Rito and Mikan getting sick of her shit}

00:17:02.780 --> 00:17:03.580
Yes?

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.330
Ah, yes.

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:10.080
Take your time, Rito-san.

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.070
Yeah.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.480
Done with the dishes.

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:28.140
Where are you going, Momo-san?

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:29.060
Eh?

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:30.440
Oh, my.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.380
I'm going back to my room, obviously.

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.320
I'll be going.

00:17:41.940 --> 00:17:43.040
Geez!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:51.540
Today certainly was tiring.

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.420
That Momo...

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:58.050
She's probably planning to barge in again today.

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.330
It's been three days in a row, after all.

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.200
I'm gonna get scolded by Mikan again...

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.180
Ah, Momo!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:04.890
Would you stop it already-

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:10.900
Mikan?!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.960
Why are you coming in?!

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:16.840
Be quiet!

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:19.450
It's a disturbance to the neighbourhood.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:23.880
There's nothing to be flustered about, right?

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:26.440
We bathed together not too long ago.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.210
Well, that's true, but...

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:30.760
But, why are you suddenly-

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:32.290
Ah, so irritating!

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:35.260
If you don't finish up I can't wash myself!

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:36.490
Mikan-

00:18:36.490 --> 00:18:38.380
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

00:18:53.030 --> 00:18:54.490
Really...

00:18:58.190 --> 00:18:59.910
Why is she doing this...?

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:09.660
Don't stare so much, okay?

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:10.470
Ah, no.

00:19:10.470 --> 00:19:12.090
It can't be helped, right?

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:16.300
Besides, it's because of you that I'm stuck having to do this in the first place.

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:18.200
What do you mean?

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:20.430
In other words...

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:24.890
Even if someone tries to come in, they can't if someone is already there.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:29.270
I'm doing it to help my pitiful big brother, so you'd better be grateful.

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:30.350
Y-Yeah.

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:33.360
I'm coming in, so move over a little.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:48.000
Was it always this small in the tub?

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:50.910
Well, we have grown bigger, after all.

00:19:50.910 --> 00:19:52.100
I see.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:56.720
There used to be space even when we were both in here.

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:58.670
People really change.

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:03.600
Back then, you couldn't even talk to girls.

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:07.180
But now you're getting into the bath with Momo-san.

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:12.590
You've really changed since Lala-san and the others came, haven't you?

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:13.830
In various ways.

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:16.230
Well, a lot has happened since then.

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:18.140
So?

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:20.360
How has it been going with Haruna-san lately?

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.090
Huh?!

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.850
What's that, so suddenly?!

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.720
I'm just interested.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.840
I was just wondering how it was going.

00:20:26.840 --> 00:20:29.150
So, has there been any kind of progress?

00:20:29.150 --> 00:20:30.290
Any kind?

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:32.390
Well, we talked a little.

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:33.460
That's all?

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:36.110
Then how about Kotegawa-san?

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:38.800
Why don't you try inviting her to a cat cafe?

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.460
Eh, Kotegawa?

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:41.460
Why?

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:44.610
Actually, if I invited her it would be a bother, wouldn't it?

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:48.610
That's really no good.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:50.470
You have to do better than that.

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:52.980
Being around you like this is such a pain.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:57.650
It's different if you're planning on
making a harem or something, though.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:05.960
What are you saying?!

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:06.950
A harem?!

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:08.000
I-!

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:18.750
Is there some reason you stood up?

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:21.480
Does that mean you have something in mind?

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:24.850
No, that's...

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:28.140
Sorry, I-I'm getting out!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.220
Ah.

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.720
Um...

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:35.280
Sorry to bother you!

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:40.360
See, it's thanks to me.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.820
No, actually...

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:47.270
I think getting you and I to have a bath together might have been her aim.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:51.000
Momo-san!

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:54.910
It's best for siblings to get along well, after all.

